# 1. PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Transform the existing NeuroScribe Android application into a complete AI-powered personal knowledge and learning platform.

The application should allow users to:

1. Record lectures, meetings, discussions, and personal voice notes.
2. Convert speech into accurate transcripts.
